  "description": "Preprod wiring: deploy/join/call (Midnight.js 4.1.1), Lace connector (dapp-connector-api 4.0.1), and the group fee-key relay. NOT exercised in CI: needs a proof server (docker), Lace, tNIGHT and DUST.",
